    title: 'Пайдалану шарттары (AGB)',
    intro: 'Бұл шарттар Simple4U SaaS платформасын пайдалануды реттейді. Тіркелу, қызметті пайдалану немесе жазылым рәсімдеу олармен келісуді білдіреді. Оператор деректемелері — Impressum (/legal/impressum).',
    section1Title: '1. Қолданылу аясы және тараптар',
    section1Body: 'These Terms apply to all contracts for using Simple4U between the provider (see Imprint) and the user (private tutor / teacher or similar self-employed person). Conflicting user terms do not apply unless the provider agrees in writing. The version in force at contract formation applies.',
    section2Title: '2. Қызмет сипаттамасы және қолжетімділік',
    section2Body: 'Simple4U is a web CRM and scheduling tool for private tutors (calendar, students, finances, notifications, optional Telegram and Stripe billing). Free includes limited features (including up to 3 active students); Pro expands limits and features as shown on Pricing. The provider aims for 99% monthly availability (excluding planned maintenance, force majeure, and third-party outages such as hosting, Stripe, or Firebase). Uninterrupted availability is not guaranteed. Tax and finance estimates are orientation only and not tax advice.',
    section3Title: '3. Тіркелу және аккаунт қауіпсіздігі',
    section3Body: 'Use requires an account with a valid email. Information must be accurate and up to date. Credentials must be kept confidential; the user is responsible for activity under the account to the extent attributable to them. The provider may suspend or terminate access in case of abuse, security risks, or material breach.',
    section4Title: '4. Бағалар, төлем және Stripe',
    section4Body: 'Current prices and billing intervals (monthly/yearly) are shown on the pricing page. Pro payments are processed by Stripe; Simple4U does not store card data. Charges follow the selected interval. Taxes (e.g. VAT) are shown where required. Failed payments may restrict Pro features.',
    section5Title: '5. Мерзім, сынақ және бас тарту',
    section5Body: 'Free may be used indefinitely while offered. Pro starts at contract formation or after any free trial shown at checkout (typically 14 days). Pro can be cancelled anytime in account settings with one click effective at period end; access continues until then, then Free applies. Pro-rata refunds only where required by law or expressly promised.',
    section6Title: '6. Тұтынушының бас тарту құқығы',
    section6Body: 'Consumers generally have a 14-day withdrawal right for distance contracts under Austrian FAGG. For digital content/services the right may lapse if performance begins with the consumer’s express prior consent and acknowledgment that the right is lost (where legally permitted). Traders and users who use Simple4U mainly for business have no FAGG withdrawal right. Withdraw to: support@simple4u.com (see also Imprint).',
    section7Title: '7. Пайдаланушы міндеттері және үшінші тұлға деректері',
    section7Body: 'Users must use Simple4U lawfully and not infringe third-party rights. The user is controller of personal data entered about students, parents, or others (Art. 4(7) GDPR) and must ensure a legal basis and information duties. The provider processes such data as processor and/or under the Privacy Policy. Required consents (e.g. Telegram) must be obtained; unlawful or harmful content is prohibited.',
    section8Title: '8. Кепілдік және жауапкершілікті шектеу',
    section8Body: 'Consumers retain statutory warranty rights. Toward businesses, the provider is liable only for intent and gross negligence and for breach of essential duties; liability for slight negligence is — where permitted — limited to foreseeable typical damage and to fees paid in the last 12 months. No liability for data loss where the user keeps no backups, for third-party outages, or for indirect damage, lost profit, or business interruption where permitted. Personal injury and mandatory liability remain unaffected.',
    section9Title: '9. AGB және баға өзгерістері',
    section9Body: 'The provider may amend Terms and prices for the future. Material changes will be communicated appropriately (e.g. email or in-product). Continued use after the effective date may constitute acceptance where legally allowed. Price increases for active subscriptions preserve statutory and contractual cancellation rights.',
    section10Title: '10. Қолданылатын құқық және соттылық',
